{
  "file_id": "ID03559",
  "text_count": 101,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Hikari couldn't possibly be the\neighth child, could she?",
      "_offset": 4,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Let's hurry up and go see Hikari.",
      "_offset": 61,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "...Yeah.",
      "_offset": 95,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "By the way, Koromon, there's\nsomething I need to tell you.",
      "_offset": 104,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "What is it, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 163,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "From now on, you're a doll. I\nmean, you have to pretend to be a\ndoll!",
      "_offset": 183,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "A doll...?",
      "_offset": 253,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Uh, I mean... you can't talk, and\nyou can't move around in front of\npeople!",
      "_offset": 264,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Got it! I'm a doll, I'm a doll!",
      "_offset": 340,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I'm worried...",
      "_offset": 372,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Hm? Is that your house, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 387,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "No, mine's on the other side... I\ngot a little too nervous.",
      "_offset": 419,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I mean, it's *my* house, but...\nwell, let's go!",
      "_offset": 481,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Wow, Taichi, your house is big!",
      "_offset": 529,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "No, no, my house isn't the\nwhole... well, whatever.",
      "_offset": 561,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "(This is the second time we're\ncome back here, but...)",
      "_offset": 613,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "(I wonder if Hikari and Mom and\nDad are here, like they should\nbe...)",
      "_offset": 668,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "(Why am I so worried about this?)",
      "_offset": 738,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Ah, Taichi, are you back from\nsummer camp?",
      "_offset": 772,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Y-yeah! They sent us home early\nbecause of abnormal weather, you\nknow.",
      "_offset": 815,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Speaking of which, the news said\nthat there was a sudden snowstorm.",
      "_offset": 886,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "A snowstorm!? Was it Yukidarumon!?",
      "_offset": 954,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Aaaack! Y-you idiot!",
      "_offset": 989,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Hey, Taichi! Ah! What are you\ndoing!? *mfffghghhhgg*",
      "_offset": 1010,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I keep telling you not to move!",
      "_offset": 1063,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Was that... a doll, just now?",
      "_offset": 1100,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Isn't it amazing? It records stuff\nand plays it back.",
      "_offset": 1130,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "It's a souvenir for Hikari.",
      "_offset": 1184,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Ah, for Hikari.",
      "_offset": 1212,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Yeah, it's impossible for a doll\nto talk...",
      "_offset": 1228,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Yeah, yeah! Ahahaha...",
      "_offset": 1272,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "It's hoooooot. It's been so hot\nlately...",
      "_offset": 1295,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I mean, it's summer, isn't it?",
      "_offset": 1337,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Yeah, but it's way too hot, more\nso than usual.",
      "_offset": 1368,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Hot!? Is it because of Meramon?",
      "_offset": 1416,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Agh, you idiot! Be quiet!",
      "_offset": 1448,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "*mffffghghf*",
      "_offset": 1474,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Hm?",
      "_offset": 1487,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Did that doll just... move?",
      "_offset": 1491,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "It couldn't have. Of course not...",
      "_offset": 1527,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Hahaha...",
      "_offset": 1562,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Seriously, though, it's getting\nway too hot. I could have sworn\nI'd just seen a doll moving...",
      "_offset": 1572,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "*whew*",
      "_offset": 1667,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Ah, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 1674,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Hey, what's going on?",
      "_offset": 1686,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "The weather's been kind of\nstrange, hasn't it? It gets hot,\nand then suddenly it gets cold...",
      "_offset": 1708,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "I know, right? I just got back\nfrom summer camp... because there\nwas a snowstorm.",
      "_offset": 1802,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "That's really bad!",
      "_offset": 1884,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Why?",
      "_offset": 1903,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "I have to observe morning glories\nfor school! They're going to wilt!",
      "_offset": 1908,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "This is a real problem!",
      "_offset": 1977,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "A problem!? Like a Digimon?",
      "_offset": 2001,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Aaaaargh! I told you not to talk!",
      "_offset": 2029,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "The doll! It talked!",
      "_offset": 2063,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "No, you're wrong.",
      "_offset": 2084,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "What am I wrong about?",
      "_offset": 2102,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "WE ARE EARTHLINGS... see, *I've*\nbeen talking.",
      "_offset": 2125,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Hmm, are you sure about that?\nWell, whatever!",
      "_offset": 2172,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I haven't been able to catch any\nbugs lately.",
      "_offset": 2218,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "No dragonflies or grasshoppers or\nstag beetles...",
      "_offset": 2264,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Stag beetles!? Like Kuwagamon?",
      "_offset": 2314,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Agh, I told you not to talk!",
      "_offset": 2345,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "...or rhinoceros beetles or\nwalking sticks or drone beetles...",
      "_offset": 2374,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "(Thank goodness. Seems like he\ndidn't hear.)",
      "_offset": 2437,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "I'm home!",
      "_offset": 2482,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Taichi? What happened? Weren't you\nat camp?",
      "_offset": 2492,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Y-yeah! They cancelled it because\nof the snow.",
      "_offset": 2536,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Snow? What's been going on with\nall this weird weather lately...\nand what's that?",
      "_offset": 2583,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Oh, this? It's a souvenir for\nHikari.",
      "_offset": 2665,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Oh? You really do care about your\nsister.",
      "_offset": 2703,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "T-Taichi?",
      "_offset": 2745,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Moooooooooooom!",
      "_offset": 2755,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "W-what's this all of a sudden?",
      "_offset": 2771,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "_offset": 2802,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Daaaaaaaaaaaaaad!",
      "_offset": 2816,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Why were you crying just now?",
      "_offset": 2834,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Don't ask me that!",
      "_offset": 2864,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 2883,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Hikari...!",
      "_offset": 2891,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Taichi... did you finish what you\nhad to do?",
      "_offset": 2902,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "No, there's still more to be done.\nAnyway, Hikari, about the incident \nat Hikarigaoka four years ago...",
      "_offset": 2947,
      "_length": 103,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Do you still remember it?",
      "_offset": 3051,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Koromon got big and fought with a\nhuge bird, right?",
      "_offset": 3077,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "_offset": 3129,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Did you forget, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 3135,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Y-yeah...",
      "_offset": 3159,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Hey, Hikari. Do you have a\nDigivice, by any chance?",
      "_offset": 3169,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "A Digivice?",
      "_offset": 3221,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "A Digivice?",
      "_offset": 3233,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Like this.",
      "_offset": 3245,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "I don't have one.",
      "_offset": 3256,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "You don't... yeah, of course you\ndon't.",
      "_offset": 3274,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Taichi, I'm sleepy...",
      "_offset": 3314,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Yeah, why don't we get some sleep?",
      "_offset": 3336,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "By the way, Taichi, have you seen\nMiko?",
      "_offset": 3371,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "I haven't. Wasn't Miko playing\noutside?",
      "_offset": 3411,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Miko? What's Miko?",
      "_offset": 3451,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Our cat.",
      "_offset": 3470,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Cat? What's a cat?",
      "_offset": 3479,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "I'll show you sometime. Come on,\nlet's go to bed.",
      "_offset": 3498,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "I wonder where Miko went...",
      "_offset": 3548,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}